[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
The IGT tests and most of the tools must be run as root and need the
Linux debugfs of the DRM driver mounted on /debug or /sys/kernel/debug.
/sys is normally a symbolic link into the kernel source tree, so /debug
is the better choice:

  mkdir -p /debug
  mount -t lindebugfs lindebugfs /debug

The test programs are installed in /usr/local/libexec/igt-gpu-tools.
Many tests change display modes or reset the GPU, so do not run them
from a graphical session you care about.
EOM
}
]
